<title>USA: Owensboro Grain confirms 150,000 T soy purchase.</title>
<headline>Owensboro Grain confirms 150,000 T soy purchase.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>An  Owensboro Grain Co official said the Owensboro, Ky-based company on Wednesday bought about 150,000 tonnes of optional-origin soybeans for May, June and July shipment.</p>
<p>&quot;Option origin beans were bought, so they could come from the U.S., Brazil, Argentina, Paraguay,&quot; said an Owensboro Grain official, who asked not to be identified.</p>
